WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:06.065
Sketch and Guess is the classic draw-it-and-guess-it party game, for two to twelve people.

2
00:00:06.765 --> 00:00:13.739
When it's your turn, you pick one of three secret words and start drawing. No letters, no numbers, no cheating.

3
00:00:13.889 --> 00:00:16.717
You've got colours and a fill bucket to work with.

4
00:00:17.417 --> 00:00:28.314
Everyone else types their guesses into the chat as fast as they can. The faster you get it, the more points you earn, and the drawer earns points too whenever somebody gets it right.

5
00:00:29.014 --> 00:00:33.047
As the clock runs down, letters of the word start appearing as hints.

6
00:00:33.197 --> 00:00:38.135
And if you're close, the game quietly tells you, so close, but only you can see it.

7
00:00:38.835 --> 00:00:46.340
Everybody draws once each round. Most points at the end wins, and the worst drawings are usually the most memorable.
